    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabyKings</strong>\u00a0is a  2D cooperative puzzle adventure where <strong>teamwork</strong> is absolutely essential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is filled with tricky puzzles and mischievous enemies that will test your coordination, reflexes, and sense of humor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> for 2\u20138 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ handcrafted levels</strong> in the free <strong>demo</strong>, and many more<strong>\u00a0levels</strong> in the full release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level brings something new</strong>, with unique layouts, mechanics, and surprises to keep your team thinking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabyKings</strong> \ud83d\udc51 is all about laughing, failing, retrying\u2014and ultimately conquering the dungeon with your royal crew.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabyKings</strong>\u00a0is a  2D cooperative puzzle adventure where <strong>teamwork</strong> is absolutely essential! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is filled with tricky puzzles and mischievous enemies that will test your coordination, reflexes, and sense of humor. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Co-op</strong> for 2\u20138 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>40+ handcrafted levels</strong> in the free <strong>demo</strong>, and many more<strong>\u00a0levels</strong> in the full release</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every level brings something new</strong>, with unique layouts, mechanics, and surprises to keep your team thinking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BabyKings</strong> \ud83d\udc51 is all about laughing, failing, retrying\u2014and ultimately conquering the dungeon with your royal crew.</p>",
